Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.30,0:00:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  罗斯太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello, Mrs. Ross. Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.09,0:00:18.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好  瑞秋先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, hello, Mr. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.27,0:00:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  我的天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa! Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.36,0:00:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  快点  快  快  快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Pheebs, hurry! Hurry, hurry, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.16,0:00:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天哪  大家都要结婚吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! Is everybody getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,教堂里不准奔跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Agh. No running in the chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.96,0:00:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你少跟我来这  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, don't you give me any of your... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:48.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们来干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯和瑞秋留言  说要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross and Rachel left us a message saying they were getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.67,0:00:54.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是来找他们的吗  当然是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't that why you guys are here? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.63,0:00:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不然我们来这儿干什么啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why else would we be here? Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:01.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  我们来晚了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what happened? Did we miss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.10,0:01:03.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也没赶上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We actually missed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可能都是因为教堂里不能奔跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Maybe you wouldn't have if you could run in the chapel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太扯了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.11,0:01:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么关系呢  又不是真结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the big deal? It's not like it's a real marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.73,0:01:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在赌城结婚  只在赌城内有效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you marry in Vegas, you're only married in Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.33,0:01:23.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么  在赌城结婚到处都有效\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? If you get married in Vegas you’re married everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的妈呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊  随便啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第六季  第1集  离开拉斯维加斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S06E01  The One After Vegas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.14,0:01:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
