Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.28,0:02:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.66,0:02:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么躺在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why are we in bed together?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.33,0:02:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有穿衣服吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you have any clothes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.88,0:02:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:05.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But we didn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿咻吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...sex, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.77,0:03:13.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不太记得昨晚的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't remember much about last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都好模糊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was such a blur. Ha, ha. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.28,0:03:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得我有笑   我一直笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember laughing. I laughed a lot. Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们没怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then we didn't have sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.87,0:03:31.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们真的醉得很惨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I mean, we were really drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸好没干什么蠢事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm glad we didn't do anything stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.33,0:03:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（新婚大囍）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  早\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morning, Pheebs. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:45.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的电影取消拍摄了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, my movie has been officially canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.85,0:03:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇啊  乔伊  好可惜喔  你要不要吃我的早餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm. Joey, I'm so sorry. You want some of my breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:52.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算了  我沮丧的吃不下啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nah, I’m too depressed to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.06,0:03:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过五分钟再说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll probably eat in, like, five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只好跟你们回去了  飞机是几点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I guess I'll fly home with you. What time is your flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.57,0:04:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的计程车呢  我用不着了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about my cab? I don't need that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.86,0:04:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你跟我借车  就要开回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Joey! you borrowed my cab. You have to drive it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.20,0:04:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想自己开回去  太寂寞了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't wanna drive back by myself. I get lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干脆你来陪我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, ooh. How about if you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.21,0:04:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道   要开很久  一定很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know, it's a long trip. That would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.71,0:04:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以聊天玩游戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We could talk and play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:21.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是让友谊变新鲜的好机会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This could be our chance to, like, renew our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我跟你〝友谊复兴〞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you asking me to have a "frienaissance"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:33.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   虽然没这个必要  但我一直爱着你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. All right, although I don't think we need one. I never stopped loving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有谁跟盖勒博士夫妇讲过话啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, has anyone talked to Dr. and Mrs. Geller yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们有留言给我   应该快到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm-hm. They left me a message. They'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服务生呢  我饿死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where is the waitress? I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是自助餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's a buffet, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以捞本了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here's where I win all my money back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.21,0:04:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事找你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I gotta talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.67,0:04:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡和我昨晚差点结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica and I almost got married last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.68,0:05:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是大事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's huge! Ha-ha-ha, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.44,0:05:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  为什么没找我去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. Why wasn't I invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁要当你的伴郎  不要说罗斯  不准说罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And who was gonna be your best man? Don't say Ross. Do not say Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们还没准备好  我很爱她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just don't think that Monica and I are ready to get married yet! Y’know? I mean, I love her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.91,0:05:32.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但看到罗斯他们从教堂冒出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but seeing Ross and Rachel come out of that chapel...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然惊觉  我们进展得太快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...was like a wake-up call that Monica and I are moving so fast, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.29,0:05:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么讲才不会让她心碎\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do I tell her without crushing her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就说她不是结婚的料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell her she's not marriage material.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:48.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:52.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,女生都这么对我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Girls say it to me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我   要是她和我一样  一定会如释重负\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And believe me, And if she's anything like me, she's just gonna be relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么说  这样太快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do I tell Chandler that it's too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.82,0:06:05.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会心碎  觉得我不爱他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It’s gonna break his heart, he’s not gonna think that I don’t love him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:07.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不爱他了  我爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you don't. Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.95,0:06:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我只是在测试你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good. I was just testing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.45,0:06:13.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  噢  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Oh, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚才聊到培根\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know, We were just talking about bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.83,0:06:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不对  我们是在聊网球\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, we were talking about tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:20.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,网球比较像真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tennis is more believable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:27.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Coffee. Heh. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.69,0:06:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样  你们要谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Are we gonna talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚的事吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about what you guys did last night, or?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:48.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚什么事  昨晚又没怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean "last night"? Nothing, uh, happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.28,0:06:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯把大家都找去看了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. Ross invited us all to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:57.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我们不可能错过朋友的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, we weren't gonna miss our friends marrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:06:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh, who got married?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们哪有结婚  怎么可能  别闹了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wh...? Hello. We didn't get married. No, we didn't. That’s ridiculous!...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我们  我记得去过教堂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, wait, wait. I remember being in a chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们醉成那样  不可能被批准结婚的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They would not let us get married when we were that drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,醉成那样  也当然可能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They let you get married when you’re drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:25.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在赌城结婚的人通常都醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Most people who marry in Vegas are drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, I'm drunk right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早餐不能喝鸡尾酒啊  我在度假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't have a mimosa with breakfast? I'm on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.33,0:07:36.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来得找个离婚律师了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I guess we find a divorce lawyer. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.45,0:07:42.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想罗斯已经有一个了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I think, I think Ross already has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.34,0:07:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次会免费吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, this one's free, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你办了两次  所以会送一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you paid for the first two, third one free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.05,0:07:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你笑吧  丢脸的是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Laugh it up, but the joke's on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不必离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because we don't need to get divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要办理注销  住校\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're just gonna get an annulment. an annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.26,0:08:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  学校可帮不了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I don't think surgery is the answer here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的正字标记\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:07.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.03,0:08:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的正字标记  你是专门离婚的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your thing, Y’know? that you're the guy who gets divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.32,0:08:13.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.99,0:08:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那才不是我的正字标记\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, that's not "my thing."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不爱离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do not love getting divorced.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.70,0:08:22.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你当然爱  这是你第三次离婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, you do. This is your third divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:26.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你爱离婚爱到搞不好会娶它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You love divorce so much, you're probably gonna marry it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后婚姻破裂  你又得离婚  离婚名人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then it won't work out, so you're gonna have to divorce it, divorcing guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.09,0:08:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我醉得好厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:45.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们该怎么办  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what should we do? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也知道我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know I love you. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们还要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So where are we on the whole "going back...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回过头去结婚吗  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to where they have the marriages" thing? I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:02.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问得好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚我们让骰子决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look umm, Last night we let the dice decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.71,0:09:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许应该再让命运决定一次  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe we should leave it up to fate again. I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.79,0:09:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错   有征兆我们才结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, We don't get married unless there's a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? So say, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.38,0:09:17.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你又掷出8来  就表示我们绝对应该结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You roll another eight, then there’s a definite sign that we should get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:19.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  8就结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Eight we get married...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其他就不结\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, 11, 12, we don't get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来不错  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds great. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人要掷了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, we got a shooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请押注\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Money, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:29.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了吗  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready? Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.11,0:09:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来个8吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.28,0:09:37.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  8\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, yes, eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:40.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,8   3加5是8\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Eight, easy eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇   居然真的是8  真是太不可能了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I can't believe I rolled an eight. That was so unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就结婚吧  我猜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's get married. I guess. Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.05,0:09:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   那不是双四八  我昨晚掷的是双四八\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. That wasn't hard eight!  Last night I rolled a hard eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  这个8不对  不能结婚了  妈的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That’s right! It was the wrong kind of eight. No wedding! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.97,0:10:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好想结婚喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Agh! Aah! Unh, I wanted it so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.93,0:10:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收拾行李去  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wanna go pack? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没做错吧  当然  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're doing the right thing, right? Oh, of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们让命运决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, we left it up to fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们应该结婚  一定会有明确的征兆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If we were supposed to get married, there would be a clear-cut sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你还剩十九个问题  要好好把握\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you have 19 questions left. Use them wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点  乔伊  你不能赢了  如果你不问\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Joey. You can't win if you don't ask any...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:37.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:43.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样啦  你说会很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? You promised me a fun road trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.22,0:10:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果我们开了六小时  你就睡了五个小时半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've been on the road for 6 hours, and you've been asleep for 5 and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:50.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到下一个休息站就换手  你给我一路开回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are switching at the next rest stop and you are going to drive all the way back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.65,0:10:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是对你的惩罚   贪睡鬼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That will be your punishment, you greedy sleeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.40,0:10:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  好啦 \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.86,0:10:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你得唱歌给我听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. And until then, you are going to sing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.90,0:11:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为收音机坏了  你又很自私  但歌声很好听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because the radio's broken, and you are selfish, but you have a nice voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.20,0:11:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是喔  快唱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.79,0:11:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna rock 'n' roll all night
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.17,0:11:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是开也开不完\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, this is a long drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.22,0:11:24.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的眼睛  睁开了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are my eyes open?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morning. Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  老公\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey, hubby. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.96,0:11:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想找你讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Actually, um, I wanted to talk to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.13,0:12:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注销婚姻的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about that whole annulment thing. Uh-huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不打算去办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就维持婚姻关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we'll just stay married.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会请大家叫我盖勒太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I will make everyone call me Mrs. Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, this is so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为得加把劲说服你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, uh, really thought I'd have to talk you into this more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.96,0:12:39.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在怕了  因为你好像不是在说笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, see now I’m scared because I don't actually think you're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.38,0:12:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.26,0:12:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I... I... Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能有三次失败的婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't have three failed marriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:49.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不要当那个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am not gonna be that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我们要永远这样下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what, we just stay married forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, how...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.61,0:13:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  你有什么影响\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How is this going to affect you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.32,0:13:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  偶尔填表格要打勾时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you fill some form out once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就勾〝已婚〞那一格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...instead of checking the box "Miss," you check the box that says, "Mrs."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.12,0:13:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在〝未婚〞旁边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's right next to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.13,0:13:22.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  抱歉  你说得对  我们确实\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ohh, Okay. I'm sorry, you're right. You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:24.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以维持现状\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We absolutely can stay married, ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为那两格离得很远\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because I was under the impression that the boxes boxes were far away from each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.76,0:13:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你就\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Look, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.56,0:13:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请你冷静下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...please take a moment here...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想一想  你在叫我做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and think about what you're asking of me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.40,0:13:44.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在请你帮我一个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am asking you to do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是要我当你的老婆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are asking me to be your wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而身为我的老婆  你应该帮我这个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, as my wife, I think you should grant me this favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个小孩踢得好用力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That kid kicked me really hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你扯他的头发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you did pull his hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.92,0:14:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他拿我的零食  我不想再争了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He took my snack. I'm not getting into this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:09.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  说真的  真的很痛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, you know what? Hurts really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就叫你不要走路  来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I told you not to walk. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There. There. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这没有任何含意吧  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This doesn't mean anything, does it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以让人搭便车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How could you pick up a hitchhiker?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他搞不好是强  强暴犯或杀人犯什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He could be a rape... He could be a rapist or a killer or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.66,0:14:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我没有先问过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't you think I asked him that before he got in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不理你了  你睡你的觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know what? I'm not talking to you. You go back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你  你是强暴犯吗  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, you, are you a rapist? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.80,0:14:47.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢车上游戏吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you like car games?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.67,0:14:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢  你会牌照游戏吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you know the, uh, license plate game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.13,0:14:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢牌照游戏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love the license plate game!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也要玩  我也要玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, I'll play. I'll play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你需要睡眠  晚安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you need your sleep. Night-night. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.15,0:15:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道你想找我谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen. I know you wanted to talk to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我有个办法  或许能让你愿意维持现状\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I have an idea that may make you wanna stay married.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们登记注册  礼物都给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We register and you get to keep all the presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  罗斯  你听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Ross, come on. No, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.04,0:15:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想要怎么表达\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}look I've thought about how to tell you this, and, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:30.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  总之我们不能维持婚姻关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}the bottom line, Ross...is we cannot stay married.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不一定  当然一定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know if that's true... Oh, but it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. Okay. You know what this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就叫做意见不合\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is a difference of opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.48,0:15:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在婚姻中遇到这种状况  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When that happens in a marriage... Oh, Ross, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是  这不是婚姻  这是全世界最惨的宿醉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is not, this is not a marriage! This is the world's worst hangover!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  听着  如果你不去注销   我也会去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, listen, if you do not get this annulment, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我去就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. All right, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.46,0:16:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:10.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对了  有没有注销婚姻送礼会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...uh, is there any such thing as an annulment shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  火车站在那里  我该下车了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait! Wait! There's the train station, where I get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有你的住址和电话号码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I have your address and phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的名字和你居无定所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I have your name and the fact that you're a drifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那主动权在你手上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So ball's pretty much in your court.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  再见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. See you, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托啦  菲比  我受不了了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Pheebs, I can't take this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:40.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你跟我说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:45.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我补偿你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me make it up to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:50.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ground control to Major Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.21,0:16:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Commencing countdown Engines on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take your protein pills And put your helmet on
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:06.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pssh, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.19,0:17:08.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop it! Stop it! No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.07,0:17:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不公平   你明知我无法抗拒  你那美妙的歌声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not fair. You know I can't resist that beautiful voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:17.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, look, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.49,0:17:20.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我答应让你旅途愉快\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know I promised you a fun road trip with your friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却没做到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I didn't deliver, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.25,0:17:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我知道  你认为保持清醒  对友情很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But-but-but now I know that you think being awake is an important part of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:33.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以后我会永远努力保持清醒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I will strive to stay awake for as long as I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.05,0:17:38.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你晚上还是可以睡觉什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can still sleep at night and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.76,0:17:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可以玩20个问题了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So can we play 20 Questions now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:47.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在堪萨斯就想到了一题  很棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got a good one. I thought about it since Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.69,0:17:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一种\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,热食三明治吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a kind of hot sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.11,0:17:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是肉丸潜水艇吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it a meatball sub?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真不可思议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是大师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are the master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有虫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aah! Bug!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真好玩  你看起来就像要  别说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah! That's funny. You look like you're... Don't say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想都别想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't even think it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.17,0:18:18.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不说就不说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你跟她耗吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay Chandler, enjoy your handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.06,0:18:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不要干脆结婚算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, should we just, should we just get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这么做  反正所有的征兆都叫我们结\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y’know? I mean should we just do it? All the signs are telling us to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.10,0:18:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想理会什么征兆了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sick of the signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样太快了  我很满意现状  我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It’s too fast, I'm happy the way things are. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.23,0:18:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想改变  你想吗  不想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't want things to change! do you? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:39.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那就不要改变  一切维持现状\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right then, then nothing changes! Everything is great!  Everything stays the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.70,0:18:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你快去整理行李  已经三天了  我快捉狂了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you go unpack because it’s been three days and it’s driving me insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别激动  又不是要结\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jeez, relax, it's not like we're mar... Aah, agh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:19:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想啊  要是我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I was thinking, what if I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.38,0:19:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里整理呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...unpack here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你的东西都会在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All your stuff would be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.98,0:19:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我的东西都在这里呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if all my stuff was here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.56,0:19:15.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就得跑来跑去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then you'd be going back and forth all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没道理嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it doesn’t make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我们同居呢  你懂我的意思吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What if we live together, and you understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.54,0:19:30.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Live together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:32.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是没有任何征兆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There've been no signs for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你  就是个征兆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me asking is kind of a sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.38,0:19:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! Yes! Yes! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.01,0:19:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  好  你等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Okay, wait. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这是给你的钥匙  给你钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Here's your key. Here's your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得出去  算正式启用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now go out and christen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.52,0:19:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出去再进来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go out and come back in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这扇门五年没锁了  不过也行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Door hasn't been locked in five years, but okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ready? Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有点问题  钥匙断了  我也进不去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, a little problem. The key broke in the lock and I can’t get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.28,0:20:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  天啊  我也出不去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. Oh, my God, I can't get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是征兆吧  不是  是钥匙很旧了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This isn't a sign! No, it’s not a sign! it's a very old key!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙太旧了  旧得不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's an old key! Oh, my God, it's old.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:16.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有抱着门吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you hugging the door right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.18,0:20:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.73,0:20:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我也没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah, me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.36,0:20:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.61,0:20:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,手续办得还顺利吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did everything go all right with the annulment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.94,0:20:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题   都办好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah. No problems. It's all taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.07,0:20:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要不要去看电影  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} Hey, do you guys wanna go see a movie?  Oh yeah, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不了  眼前就有一出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No thanks, I've already seen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.17,0:20:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我去穿毛衣  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, um, I'm gonna get my sweater. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.63,0:21:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想不想听一件奇怪的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. You uh, you wanna wanna hear something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:03.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没去办注销\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't get the annulment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.56,0:21:12.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我们还是夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? We're still married.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:15.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要告诉瑞秋   待会儿见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't tell Rachel. See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.32,0:21:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（献给真的结婚的寇妮与大卫）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:30.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙断在钥匙孔里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Key is stuck in the lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.66,0:21:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会修  等下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can fix it. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让开  让开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Watch out, watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.05,0:21:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是打不开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It still doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没弄完  噢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not finished. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.94,0:22:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漂亮   你的技术真好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nice job, Joe. You are quite the craftsman.
